title: "vector_simd_delphi - SIMD Operations Library for Delphi Integration"
abstract: "A dynamic library written in C that provides highly optimized, vectorized mathematical operations (Addition, Multiplication, FMA, and Reduction) for double-precision arrays using Intel SIMD instructions (AVX/SSE2), wrapped for Delphi Pascal."
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-05-19
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/HPC-Delphi/vector_simd_delphi"
keywords:
